                MIN 2 Banyumas — Portal Terintegrasi & Penerimaan Peserta Didik Baru Online
              </h4>
              <span class="font-body text-sm md:text-base font-medium text-secondary">
                Laravel 12, Tailwind CSS v4, Midtrans API
              </span>
            </div>
            <ul class="pt-2 list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
              <li class="font-body font-light text-primary">
                Mengembangkan sistem informasi madrasah siap produksi dengan alur PPDB online end-to-end yang dilengkapi kode registrasi otomatis dan validasi dokumen.
              </li>
              <li class="font-body font-light text-primary">
                Mengimplementasikan sistem pembayaran terintegrasi via Midtrans API (Snap Token & verifikasi webhook otomatis).
              </li>
              <li class="font-body font-light text-primary">
                Membangun modul pengumuman kelulusan online berbasis NISN yang secara dinamis menerbitkan dokumen SKL terverifikasi dengan kode QR.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Pancacinta -->
          <div class="project-item">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline flex-wrap gap-2">
              <h4 class="font-body text-xl font-semibold text-primary">
                Pancacinta — Mini LMS & Pelacak Aktivitas Siswa
              </h4>
              <span class="font-body text-sm md:text-base font-medium text-secondary">
                Laravel 13, Alpine.js, PWA, WebPush API
              </span>
            </div>
            <ul class="pt-2 list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
              <li class="font-body font-light text-primary">
                Merancang LMS hierarkis multi-peran untuk Superadmin, Admin, Guru, Siswa, dan Orang Tua, dengan kontrol akses Spatie Permission.
              </li>
              <li class="font-body font-light text-primary">
                Membangun modul ujian online aman dengan verifikasi waktu di sisi server, auto-save per pertanyaan, dan perhitungan nilai otomatis secara instan.
              </li>
              <li class="font-body font-light text-primary">
                Men-deploy sebagai Progressive Web App (PWA) yang dapat diinstal dengan fallback offline, notifikasi pengingat terjadwal, dan penyimpanan terintegrasi Cloudflare R2 dengan kompresi gambar WebP on-the-fly.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Aplikasi Web Photobooth -->
          <div class="project-item">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline flex-wrap gap-2">
              <h4 class="font-body text-xl font-semibold text-primary">
                Aplikasi Web Photobooth
              </h4>
              <span class="font-body text-sm md:text-base font-medium text-secondary">
                React.js, Tailwind, Vercel
              </span>
            </div>
            <ul class="pt-2 list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
              <li class="font-body font-light text-primary">
                Membuat aplikasi photo booth berbasis peramban (browser) responsif dengan streaming webcam real-time dan pengambilan multi-shot otomatis.
              </li>
              <li class="font-body font-light text-primary">
                Mengimplementasikan rendering canvas langsung untuk layout photo strip estetis, mendukung kustomisasi interaktif instan dan unduhan resolusi tinggi dalam satu klik.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- PENGALAMAN PROFESIONAL -->
      <div class="border-b border-black py-8 lg:py-12 text-justify exp-section">
        <div class="flex items-center pb-6">
          <h3 class="font-body text-2xl font-semibold text-primary">
            PENGALAMAN PROFESIONAL
          </h3>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-8 exp-list">
          <div class="exp-item">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start flex-wrap gap-2">
              <div>
                <a
                  href="https://lowcosthost.id"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="font-body text-xl font-semibold text-primary hover:text-secondary hover:underline transition-colors"
                >
                  lowcosthost.id
                </a>
                <p class="pt-1 font-body text-lg font-medium text-secondary">
                  Infrastructure Engineer & Tim Teknis
                </p>
              </div>
              <span class="font-body text-base text-primary font-medium">
                Jan 2026 – Sekarang
              </span>
            </div>
            <ul class="pt-3 list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
              <li class="font-body font-light text-primary">
                Menjalankan pemeliharaan berkelanjutan dan optimasi server VPS/Linux tingkat lanjut melalui Nginx pada 15+ website produksi, memastikan stabilitas sistem dalam menangani konkurensi lalu lintas tinggi.
              </li>
              <li class="font-body font-light text-primary">
                Mengelola deployment web dan arsitektur database secara seamless memanfaatkan CI/CD pipeline melalui GitHub Actions.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- PENDIDIKAN & SERTIFIKASI -->
      <div class="border-b border-black py-8 lg:py-12 edu-cert-section">
        <div class="flex items-center pb-6">
          <h3 class="font-body text-2xl font-semibold text-primary">
            PENDIDIKAN & SERTIFIKASI
          </h3>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <!-- Kolom Pendidikan -->
          <div class="space-y-6 edu-item">
            <h4 class="font-body text-xl font-semibold text-primary border-b border-grey-light pb-2">
              Pendidikan
            </h4>
            <div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-start flex-wrap gap-1">
                <h5 class="font-body text-lg font-semibold text-primary">
                  Telkom University Purwokerto
                </h5>
              </div>
              <p class="pt-1 font-body text-base text-secondary font-medium">
                S1 Sistem Informasi (Bachelor of Information Systems)
              </p>
              <p class="pt-1 font-body font-light text-primary">
                IPK: <strong>3.76 / 4.00</strong>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Kolom Sertifikasi -->
          <div class="space-y-6 cert-item">
            <h4 class="font-body text-xl font-semibold text-primary border-b border-grey-light pb-2">
              Sertifikasi
            </h4>
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div>
                <h5 class="font-body text-lg font-semibold text-primary">
                  Google AI Professional Certificate
                </h5>
                <p class="font-body text-sm font-medium text-secondary">Coursera</p>
              </div>

              <div>
                <h5 class="font-body text-lg font-semibold text-primary">
                  Google Cybersecurity Professional Certificate
                </h5>
                <p class="font-body text-sm font-medium text-secondary">Coursera</p>
              </div>

              <div>
                <h5 class="font-body text-lg font-semibold text-primary">
                  Sertifikasi Pengembang Web BNSP
                </h5>
                <p class="font-body text-sm font-medium text-secondary">LSP Informatika</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <Footer />
  </main>
</Layout>

<script>
  // Lazy load html2pdf library only when needed
  function loadHtml2Pdf(): Promise<any> {
    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
      if ((window as any).html2pdf) {
        resolve((window as any).html2pdf);
        return;
      }
      const script = document.createElement("script");
      script.src =
        "https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/html2pdf.js/0.10.1/html2pdf.bundle.min.js";
      script.onload = () => resolve((window as any).html2pdf);
      script.onerror = reject;
      document.head.appendChild(script);
    });
  }

  document
    .getElementById("download-pdf")
    ?.addEventListener("click", async () => {
      const button = document.getElementById("download-pdf");
      const element = document.getElementById("main");
      const footer = document.querySelector("footer");

      // Show loading indicator
      if (button) {
        button.innerHTML =
          '<svg class="animate-spin h-6 w-6" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle class="opacity-25" cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"></circle><path class="opacity-75" fill="currentColor" d="M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4zm2 5.291A7.962 7.962 0 014 12H0c0 3.042 1.135 5.824 3 7.938l3-2.647z"></path></svg>';
      }

      try {
        await loadHtml2Pdf();

        const isMobile = window.innerWidth <= 768;

        if (button) button.style.display = "none";
        if (footer) footer.style.display = "none";

        document.body.classList.add("generating-pdf");
        if (isMobile) {
          document.body.classList.add("mobile-pdf");
        }

        const pdfFormat = isMobile ? [150, 297] : "a4";

        const opt = {
          margin: isMobile ? [0, 3, 3, 3] : [0, 5, 5, 5],
          filename: "CV_Urip_Yoga_Pangestu_ID.pdf",
          image: { type: "jpeg", quality: 0.95 },
          html2canvas: {
            scale: isMobile ? 2.8 : 1.8,
            useCORS: true,
            letterRendering: true,
            logging: false,
            scrollY: 0,
            scrollX: 0,
            windowWidth: element ? element.scrollWidth : undefined,
            windowHeight: element ? element.scrollHeight : undefined,
          },
          jsPDF: {
            unit: "mm",
            format: pdfFormat,
            orientation: "portrait",
            compress: true,
          },
          pagebreak: {
            mode: ["avoid-all", "css"],
            avoid: [".project-item", ".exp-item", ".edu-item", ".cert-item", "h1", "h2", "h3", "h4"],
          },
        };

        (window as any)
          .html2pdf()
          .set(opt)
          .from(element)
          .toPdf()
          .get("pdf")
          .then((pdf: any) => {
            window.scrollTo(0, 0);
            return pdf;
          })
          .save()
          .then(() => {
            document.body.classList.remove("generating-pdf");
            document.body.classList.remove("mobile-pdf");

            if (button) {
              button.style.display = "block";
              button.innerHTML =
                '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path></svg>';
            }
            if (footer) footer.style.display = "block";
          });
      } catch (error) {
        console.error("Failed to generate PDF:", error);
        if (button) {
          button.innerHTML =
            '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path></svg>';
        }
        alert("Gagal mengunduh PDF. Silakan coba lagi.");
      }
    });
</script>

<style>
  .pdf-content {
    padding-top: 1rem !important;
  }

  /* Mobile PDF specific optimizations */
  body.generating-pdf.mobile-pdf .project-item,
  body.generating-pdf.mobile-pdf .exp-item,
  body.generating-pdf.mobile-pdf .edu-item,
  body.generating-pdf.mobile-pdf .cert-item {
    page-break-inside: avoid !important;
    break-inside: avoid !important;
    margin-bottom: 1rem !important;
  }

  body.generating-pdf.mobile-pdf .project-list,
  body.generating-pdf.mobile-pdf .exp-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  body.generating-pdf.mobile-pdf h3,
  body.generating-pdf.mobile-pdf h4 {
    page-break-after: avoid !important;
    break-after: avoid !important;
  }

  /* Reduce font sizes for mobile PDF */
  body.generating-pdf.mobile-pdf h1 {
    font-size: 2rem !important;
  }

  body.generating-pdf.mobile-pdf h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem !important;
  }

  body.generating-pdf.mobile-pdf h4 {
    font-size: 1.1rem !important;
  }

  body.generating-pdf.mobile-pdf .font-body {
    font-size: 0.85rem !important;
    line-height: 1.4 !important;
  }

  body.generating-pdf.mobile-pdf ul {
    padding-left: 1.5rem !important;
  }

  body.generating-pdf.mobile-pdf .space-y-8 > * + * {
    margin-top: 1.2rem !important;
  }

  body.generating-pdf.mobile-pdf .py-8,
  body.generating-pdf.mobile-pdf .lg\:py-12 {
    padding-top: 1rem !important;
    padding-bottom: 1rem !important;
  }

  @media print {
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
      print-color-adjust: exact;
      margin: 0 !important;
      padding: 0 !important;
    }

    #download-pdf,
    footer,
    .no-print {
      display: none !important;
    }

    #main {
      padding-top: 0 !important;
      margin-top: 0 !important;
    }

    .pdf-content {
      padding-top: 0 !important;
      margin-top: 0 !important;
    }

    .first-section {
      padding-top: 0.5rem !important;
      margin-top: 0 !important;
    }

    .border-b,
    .project-section,
    .exp-section,
    .edu-cert-section {
      page-break-inside: avoid !important;
      break-inside: avoid-page !important;
    }

    .project-item,
    .exp-item,
    .edu-item,
    .cert-item {
      page-break-inside: avoid !important;
      break-inside: avoid !important;
      display: block !important;
    }

    h1 {
      page-break-after: avoid !important;
      page-break-before: avoid !important;
      break-after: avoid !important;
      break-before: avoid !important;
      padding-top: 0.25rem !important;
    }

    h2,
    h3,
    h4 {
      page-break-after: avoid !important;
      break-after: avoid !important;
    }

    ul,
    ol {
      page-break-inside: avoid !important;
      break-inside: avoid !important;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 100% !important;
    }
  }
</style>
